1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
这早餐，外地人闻一口想逃
One whiff sends outsiders running

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
老北京·豆汁儿配焦圈
Old Beijing — douzhi and jiaoquan

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
绿豆做粉剩的渣，发酵成汁
Fermented mung-bean starch dregs

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,200
那股酸味，北京人偏上瘾
That sour tang — Beijingers get hooked

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,400
一碗豆汁儿，三百年的味道
One bowl — a 300-year-old taste

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,600
乾隆年间就喝进了宫
It reached the palace in Qianlong's reign

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,800
焦圈儿"小油鬼"，炸得焦脆
Jiaoquan — crisp little fried rings

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,000
配一碟辣咸菜丝儿，才地道
With spicy pickle shreds — that's proper

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,200
酸辣甜咸，一口占了四味
Sour, spicy, sweet, salty — all at once

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
豆汁儿，你敢喝一口吗？
Douzhi — would you dare a sip?

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,000
下集：河南人的"糊辣鲜香"
Next: Henan's thick spicy morning soup
